{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_030_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:57c49cfb120b730c2f14b3292be00d77c5abf136588fea85ec43d9520ab70f91",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61f293bfae675dd8eafc6506f8de0b8fe63cc2ac740715143b388e9bfa825a86",
      "text": "蛋糕带来的相遇",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99a91b10dcfa73c9fd1d1deab929965a40210e6ec29b46c3b93158678453e0ee",
      "text": "杂志拍摄结束后，回到事务所的\n卷绪和制作人。制作人一边歇口气，\n一边询问起因工作和练习增加而看似忙碌的\n卷绪的现状。卷绪以“像社团活动一样开心”\n为切入点聊了起来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61f293bfae675dd8eafc6506f8de0b8fe63cc2ac740715143b388e9bfa825a86",
      "text": "蛋糕带来的相遇",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8960bc1766cb8aa140c01808f87a882d45e09baad68f3635c28a41df4d105aa3",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n让您久等了。我把行李拿过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4609ab1377488a34d170034ee81b2599eb918044975691cbaa4a789ad1e170c9",
      "text": "不用着急的。我也是刚刚才跟各位\n打完招呼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db2418010b28979783b2d35d2ec856a33abe5a4f0c712e8d0bb0c168b4a4c95e",
      "text": "今天的工作就到此结束了。\n如果您打算直接回家的话，要一起去车站吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38a50b5fe2df9343a916f0072cdfb38039798a5ca2d776fcff52168050b92b6f",
      "text": "我打算之后顺道去一趟事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccde90954f92851ba97d9c1f3f7a41d3a25a9dfb30beb7f9bcaa0092d4bb7fc7",
      "text": "制作人要是也回事务所的话，\n要不要一起走？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffe8ffde0daf48b005b6deb6988de4eaa4408b4a542f1d590e4b99fe54cd031d",
      "text": "我也正有此意，务必一起。到了事务所之后，\n要是您有时间的话，要稍微聊聊吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0265d6449b0b974a6984b2ebdbd42bad5001ace9c7723e4b90d1891553cca17",
      "text": "诶，可以吗。我也正好想跟制作人\n聊聊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9204df195105031e8a2d13fe4dfb245770ab882a146a55831a93de4580c8769",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。能问您一声\n真是太好了！那我们回去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:393b1b6c53e476fa9fbae85070babbfb42eb7edc048bd26d25d0e1b339416386",
      "text": "好的！啊，在那之前！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f3d4497ba4c2a7c23930a8e01444329c85027ed1273158bc79eedcae71dcc18",
      "text": "各位，辛苦大家了！\n我先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
